                  "stats": {
                    "id": "levelled_description_0046f1ac894a",
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You were born with a strange blessing: bereft of the typical halfling luck, you can instead manipulate the fortunes of others. You can never take the Halfling Luck feat, and you gain the Jinx action.\n\n**Jinx**\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** curse, occult\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou can curse another creature with clumsiness. This curse has a range of 30 feet, and you must be able to see your target. The target gets a Will saving throw against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.\n\n- **Success:** The target is unaffected and temporarily immune for 24 hours.\n- **Failure:** The target is clumsy 1 for 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is clumsy 2 for 1 minute."
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
